The snapshot includes the experiment's task adaptations. It is not claimed to
be an unmodified checkout of the recorded upstream reference 309866f.

The harness was adapted for sharing: relative installation paths, scoped
sessions, foreground server lifecycle, no global skill mutation, and a
deterministic demonstration of passing normal apps and rejecting mutations.
